{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1499870-what-are-some-examples-of-volatile-tass","id":1499870,"title":"What are some examples of Volatile Tass","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-12-16T11:19:04-08:00","id":1499870,"title":"What are some examples of Volatile Tass","content":"Signs of Sorcery includes a neat little segment on Hallow Features, which includes a small section on Volatile Tass. Volatile Tass is Tass that comes in a form that is toxic or cursed. Has anyone ever used this concept, or had neat ideas on it?<br /> <br /> For example, a cosmetic curse could be a sacred spring that has clear waters that cause one to lose all hair on the body. A more creepy one could be an abandoned hospital with self-filling needles, that cause hallucinations of violent events to friends and loved ones, giving the shaken condition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-16T11:52:05-08:00","id":1499872,"title":"","content":"Angst refined from wraiths and Spectres I tended to suggest using it raw had unpleasant side affects","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-16T12:04:31-08:00","id":1499876,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1499870-what-are-some-examples-of-volatile-tass?p=1499872#post1499872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Angst refined from wraiths and Spectres I tended to suggest using it raw had unpleasant side affects</div> </div> </div> </div>Wraith, huh. Never read much World of Darkness stuff. Was Angst like ectoplasm where it has a physical form? Actually, fluid gathered from a perpetually Haunted location could be quite interesting, with it always being deathly cold and inflicting hypothermia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-16T12:11:45-08:00","id":1499877,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1499870-what-are-some-examples-of-volatile-tass?p=1499876#post1499876\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wraith, huh. Never read much World of Darkness stuff. Was Angst like ectoplasm where it has a physical form? Actually, fluid gathered from a perpetually Haunted location could be quite interesting, with it always being deathly cold and inflicting hypothermia.</div> </div> </div> </div>Angst is a negative karma bar in Wraith. In setting its raw psychic pain which slowly corrupts a Wraith. its described as a foul black go which stinks and has a strong entropic resonance if refined from a Wraith.<br /> <br /> I tend to rule its dangerous and unstable, I had a mage who refined it into a safer neutral tass by channeling dreams of love through it. But in its base form its probably very good for morbid or dark rituals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 12-16-2022, 03:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-16T13:53:37-08:00","id":1499901,"title":"","content":"Something like the Jusenkyo from Ranma. You draw the Mana by splashing yourself with its waters, but end up shapeshifting into whatever was last immersed in it. Fortunately, expunging the Mana gained this way immediately reverses the transformation. Good for mages. Not for anyone who doesn\u2019t know how to spend Mana.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-12-16T14:33:04-08:00","id":1499909,"title":"","content":"An uptick in those &quot;canceled Sims order&quot; moments, where you enter a room and can't for the life of you remember what you were going to do","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><